{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/576f2b87ef4efab15eea046974874c40.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/576f2b87ef4efab15eea046974874c40.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/d46c13ce02b8a1f9786fcc08c34fc99a.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/d46c13ce02b8a1f9786fcc08c34fc99a.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=1090 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/83924ddbe6d507de3d016fb12612a96f.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/83924ddbe6d507de3d016fb12612a96f.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, humanity used the power of lustan to restrain monster babes endowed with immense power, and were thereby able to live in peaceful coexistence with them for hundreds of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, for reasons unknown, humans gradually lost the ability to wield lustan. The monster babes fell into a state of chaos and began attacking humans, leading to the collapse of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary young man living in the declining kingdom of Solowon. One day, fate would have it that you accidentally awaken the long-lost power of lustan, allowing you to subdue the dangerous monster babes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid being drained of your essence, you are forced to strike back against the swarms, and must actively explore the four major regions of the land. Capture monster babes, form contracts with them, and search for a way to stop the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11d26b54e79207c4cffd7dda01bd7fad.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/11d26b54e79207c4cffd7dda01bd7fad.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you embark on an adventure, the stage is completely regenerated, ensuring that every expedition contains different routes and combat environments. Adapt to these changes and hone your reactions to survive in this strange, unforgiving world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/1ccc1861f0581bd176af50eb011a7273.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/1ccc1861f0581bd176af50eb011a7273.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/1ccc1861f0581bd176af50eb011a7273.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/4e0f1d79fdd341bac84071ea660f11d2.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/4e0f1d79fdd341bac84071ea660f11d2.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These lands are home to all kinds of monsters. What looks like a harmless, pitiful creature just might unleash a brain-blasting barrage of bullets. Stay on your toes...or die! Fortunately, you possess a unique ability\u2014you can capture any monster and have them fight for you! Each monster has its own distinctive shooting style. Make good use of their abilities and adapt on the fly to gain the upper hand on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/7a9274fe3e6cd7b19ddb1039076d0f3c.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/7a9274fe3e6cd7b19ddb1039076d0f3c.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/7a9274fe3e6cd7b19ddb1039076d0f3c.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/fc39141531275637a393977a09b8e2d5.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/fc39141531275637a393977a09b8e2d5.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 12 puchimon that can transform into stunning humanoid forms. Build bonds with them and unlock a variety of exclusive, amazing events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After evolving, the puchimon don't just turn into irresistible eye candy, they can also unleash more power during battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/ea6ce7699ca86a10980331f638c1da68.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/ea6ce7699ca86a10980331f638c1da68.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/ea6ce7699ca86a10980331f638c1da68.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/c5b7a549508344aa5cc5afa0440c5f7e.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/c5b7a549508344aa5cc5afa0440c5f7e.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimosa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flower spirits are known to be a fragile race, yet Mimosa possesses formidable magical power. Despite this gift, she is perpetually haunted by self-doubt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your presence, she shyly conceals her intense emotions and primal desires. To preserve her purity, she has chosen a life of abstinence, struggling to suppress the yearning that burns deep within her soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11c86fa46432d9ff392136cfe52fa039.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11c86fa46432d9ff392136cfe52fa039.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11c86fa46432d9ff392136cfe52fa039.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camerys </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a fickle and ever-changing personality, Camerys  loves to stay in control. Driven by a powerful urge to dominate, she is the embodiment of a pure hedonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She unashamedly unleashes her desires in every possible way. Far from seeing you as her master, she believes the reality is quite the opposite\u2014you are the one under her thumb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/9cc14b677ff5128e97c950c3bf09f5a6.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/9cc14b677ff5128e97c950c3bf09f5a6.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/9cc14b677ff5128e97c950c3bf09f5a6.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sif</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by a powerful protective instinct, Sif views the care of all aquatic life as her sacred duty, the very embodiment of a compassionate mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While she is gracious toward all creatures, she harbors a deep-seated hatred for humanity, plotting her revenge by any means necessary. However, consumed by her own obsession, she has unwittingly become the very source of the calamity plaguing the oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6881786fe95d70a8217c90f8dee7e01e.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6881786fe95d70a8217c90f8dee7e01e.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6881786fe95d70a8217c90f8dee7e01e.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yurin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Puchimon dwelling in an ancient underground fortress, Yurin commands formidable magical power. At its peak, her influence can reach the surface, plunging the world into a cataclysmic ice age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to her frigid exterior and overwhelming strength, both humans and Puchimon alike keep a respectful distance. In reality, she is merely a lonely, innocent girl who yearns for companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6c188a4fc0189f9dddad38dfa0b45356.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6c188a4fc0189f9dddad38dfa0b45356.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6c188a4fc0189f9dddad38dfa0b45356.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mona</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cheery innkeeper who frequently lends the protagonist a helping hand on their journey. Perched on her shoulder is always a cranky little Gripu named &quot;Black Warlord.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She sells all sorts of peculiar oddities and has zero patience for men who try to haggle over prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/257ec6cd3a3ff68044f320d5886676d9.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/257ec6cd3a3ff68044f320d5886676d9.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/257ec6cd3a3ff68044f320d5886676d9.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/30741faa5d6d4a79d7fc39f68d3588b8.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/30741faa5d6d4a79d7fc39f68d3588b8.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfGet ready to capture 25 types of puchimon with over 50 different visual variations. Each puchimon has its own unique attack style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfA total of 12 puchimon can evolve into sexy, seductive humanoid forms. Grow closer with your monster babes and unlock a wide range of spicy events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfOver 70 pieces of gear that can be freely mixed and matched. Combine to create a shooting style that's uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExplore ever-changing labryinths\u2014every adventure is a brand-new experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743810?t=1774018640","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743810?t=1774018640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/f5fb560d90f3e4fd9199eedd12b79cb9aeb291a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774018640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/f5fb560d90f3e4fd9199eedd12b79cb9aeb291a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774018640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game include furry characters with revealing outfits and some flirting interaction in the story ."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/576f2b87ef4efab15eea046974874c40.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/576f2b87ef4efab15eea046974874c40.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/d46c13ce02b8a1f9786fcc08c34fc99a.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/d46c13ce02b8a1f9786fcc08c34fc99a.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=1090 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/83924ddbe6d507de3d016fb12612a96f.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/83924ddbe6d507de3d016fb12612a96f.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, humanity used the power of lustan to restrain monster babes endowed with immense power, and were thereby able to live in peaceful coexistence with them for hundreds of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, for reasons unknown, humans gradually lost the ability to wield lustan. The monster babes fell into a state of chaos and began attacking humans, leading to the collapse of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary young man living in the declining kingdom of Solowon. One day, fate would have it that you accidentally awaken the long-lost power of lustan, allowing you to subdue the dangerous monster babes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid being drained of your essence, you are forced to strike back against the swarms, and must actively explore the four major regions of the land. Capture monster babes, form contracts with them, and search for a way to stop the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11d26b54e79207c4cffd7dda01bd7fad.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/11d26b54e79207c4cffd7dda01bd7fad.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you embark on an adventure, the stage is completely regenerated, ensuring that every expedition contains different routes and combat environments. Adapt to these changes and hone your reactions to survive in this strange, unforgiving world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/1ccc1861f0581bd176af50eb011a7273.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/1ccc1861f0581bd176af50eb011a7273.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/1ccc1861f0581bd176af50eb011a7273.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/4e0f1d79fdd341bac84071ea660f11d2.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/4e0f1d79fdd341bac84071ea660f11d2.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These lands are home to all kinds of monsters. What looks like a harmless, pitiful creature just might unleash a brain-blasting barrage of bullets. Stay on your toes...or die! Fortunately, you possess a unique ability\u2014you can capture any monster and have them fight for you! Each monster has its own distinctive shooting style. Make good use of their abilities and adapt on the fly to gain the upper hand on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/7a9274fe3e6cd7b19ddb1039076d0f3c.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/7a9274fe3e6cd7b19ddb1039076d0f3c.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/7a9274fe3e6cd7b19ddb1039076d0f3c.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/fc39141531275637a393977a09b8e2d5.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/fc39141531275637a393977a09b8e2d5.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 12 puchimon that can transform into stunning humanoid forms. Build bonds with them and unlock a variety of exclusive, amazing events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After evolving, the puchimon don't just turn into irresistible eye candy, they can also unleash more power during battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/ea6ce7699ca86a10980331f638c1da68.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/ea6ce7699ca86a10980331f638c1da68.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/ea6ce7699ca86a10980331f638c1da68.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/c5b7a549508344aa5cc5afa0440c5f7e.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/c5b7a549508344aa5cc5afa0440c5f7e.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimosa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flower spirits are known to be a fragile race, yet Mimosa possesses formidable magical power. Despite this gift, she is perpetually haunted by self-doubt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your presence, she shyly conceals her intense emotions and primal desires. To preserve her purity, she has chosen a life of abstinence, struggling to suppress the yearning that burns deep within her soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11c86fa46432d9ff392136cfe52fa039.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11c86fa46432d9ff392136cfe52fa039.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/11c86fa46432d9ff392136cfe52fa039.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camerys </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a fickle and ever-changing personality, Camerys  loves to stay in control. Driven by a powerful urge to dominate, she is the embodiment of a pure hedonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She unashamedly unleashes her desires in every possible way. Far from seeing you as her master, she believes the reality is quite the opposite\u2014you are the one under her thumb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/9cc14b677ff5128e97c950c3bf09f5a6.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/9cc14b677ff5128e97c950c3bf09f5a6.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/9cc14b677ff5128e97c950c3bf09f5a6.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sif</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by a powerful protective instinct, Sif views the care of all aquatic life as her sacred duty, the very embodiment of a compassionate mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While she is gracious toward all creatures, she harbors a deep-seated hatred for humanity, plotting her revenge by any means necessary. However, consumed by her own obsession, she has unwittingly become the very source of the calamity plaguing the oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6881786fe95d70a8217c90f8dee7e01e.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6881786fe95d70a8217c90f8dee7e01e.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6881786fe95d70a8217c90f8dee7e01e.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yurin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Puchimon dwelling in an ancient underground fortress, Yurin commands formidable magical power. At its peak, her influence can reach the surface, plunging the world into a cataclysmic ice age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to her frigid exterior and overwhelming strength, both humans and Puchimon alike keep a respectful distance. In reality, she is merely a lonely, innocent girl who yearns for companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6c188a4fc0189f9dddad38dfa0b45356.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6c188a4fc0189f9dddad38dfa0b45356.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/6c188a4fc0189f9dddad38dfa0b45356.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mona</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cheery innkeeper who frequently lends the protagonist a helping hand on their journey. Perched on her shoulder is always a cranky little Gripu named &quot;Black Warlord.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She sells all sorts of peculiar oddities and has zero patience for men who try to haggle over prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/257ec6cd3a3ff68044f320d5886676d9.poster.avif?t=1774018640\" width=1170 height=1560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/257ec6cd3a3ff68044f320d5886676d9.webm?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/257ec6cd3a3ff68044f320d5886676d9.mp4?t=1774018640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras/30741faa5d6d4a79d7fc39f68d3588b8.avif?t=1774018640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/extras_big/30741faa5d6d4a79d7fc39f68d3588b8.webp?t=1774018640 width=1560 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfGet ready to capture 25 types of puchimon with over 50 different visual variations. Each puchimon has its own unique attack style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfA total of 12 puchimon can evolve into sexy, seductive humanoid forms. Grow closer with your monster babes and unlock a wide range of spicy events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfOver 70 pieces of gear that can be freely mixed and matched. Combine to create a shooting style that's uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExplore ever-changing labryinths\u2014every adventure is a brand-new experience!</p>","developers":["\u786c\u733f\u56e3 O.U.E.N. Apes"],"dlc":[3769200],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743810/02bc61bf16fc8c02f785dbdc82ceb784927dfc37/header.jpg?t=1774018640","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743810/1720050506/697fc59236a65640e870e7b2664255f9178c7ceb/1773821469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773973260","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743810/1720050506/697fc59236a65640e870e7b2664255f9178c7ceb/1773821469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773973260","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743810/1720050506/697fc59236a65640e870e7b2664255f9178c7ceb/1773821469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773973260","id":257305258,"name":"PuchimonPV_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257305258/54be75b05d816ae663057406858d8b20be858a83/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773973260"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743810/431422575/10d221e69104f4460b46468f4f932cbd3dbc0722/1774017913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774018639","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743810/431422575/10d221e69104f4460b46468f4f932cbd3dbc0722/1774017913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774018639","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743810/431422575/10d221e69104f4460b46468f4f932cbd3dbc0722/1774017913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774018639","id":257