87eb425246566bc14e1152/ss_d394ed3fd60323f4d787eb425246566bc14e1152.600x338.jpg?t=1774018640"}],"short_description":"Journey across a continent teeming with diverse monsters! Capture them through intense bullet-hell battles and grow stronger together. With an in-depth nurturing system, you can build bonds with your &quot;Puchimon&quot; to unlock exclusive storylines and turn them into your ultimate battle partners!","steam_appid":3743810,"support_info":{"email":"support@mangopartygames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}